(iv) venting, not including grommet(s);
(v) articulated elbows or knees;
(vi) reinforcement in one of the following areas: the elbows, shoulders, seat, knees, ankles or cuffs; (vii) weatherproof closure at the waist or front; (viii) multi-adjustable hood or adjustable collar;
(ix) adjustable powder skirt, inner protective skirt or adjustable inner protective cuff at sleeve hem;
